{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1701.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"83c89de80f65772a49716d7c11e173f421055bca882596d5702849ed51ed70f6","ja":"この辺りは地酒もあるのね。\nこっちも、すっごくおいしいわよ♪","zh":"这附近也有当地的酒呢。\n这个也超级好喝哦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1701.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"856023eb8ffc18abbb65bdf9b665cb0239bd04467e6b7fd3a9052294f1e92fd7","ja":"「ディレクター。馬場さん、\nお酒飲んでますけど大丈夫でしょうか？」","zh":"“导演。马场小姐在喝酒，\n真的没问题吗？”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1701.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"3ffe5393ffd5cacceb10d407dfadd8f40697d9d83795b66ef53e971c97d9d145","ja":"「念のため、『馬場このみさんは成人してるので、\nお酒が飲めます』ってテロップを出しとくか……」","zh":"“保险起见，还是打上‘马场木实已经成年，\n可以饮酒’的字幕吧……”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1701.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"4ed283e893a9527b7e63bcffeff1865a4bc93f01ac797e32f8e16b44e6906fd3","ja":"「ありがとうございました！　ちょっと\nバタバタしましたが、楽しい映像が撮れました！」","zh":"「非常感谢大家！虽然稍微\n有点手忙脚乱，但拍到了很有趣的画面！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1701.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"f7134d1f85c5be49a86b087062e63da8927b9ef4c432ec515e6f58f4f9eadc09","ja":"ありがとうございます！\n最初は予定外だったけど、うまくできたわね。","zh":"谢谢！\n虽说一开始在意料之外，但完成得很顺利呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1701.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"c40f50454480f678ecf1443a838a38cd45e16e279ced7a7be224110c09edf45b","ja":"んでんで、レポート対決はどっちの勝ちなの？","zh":"然后然后，报告对决到底是谁赢了啊？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1701.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"fb63da7a0532d22beb4ccae1e65a1f93ecb3618d5baf5fd87f9fdbe93d9c4df0","ja":"どうかしら？　少し時間があるそうだし、これから\n入り損ねた温泉に行って、ゆっくりお話ししましょ♪","zh":"意下如何？既然听说还有点时间，\n接下来不如去泡泡之前错过的温泉，好好聊一聊吧♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
